<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>(a) List the elements of <m>{\{x : x \text{ is an integer}, -3 &lt; x \le 2\}}</m>.</p><p><fillin characters="25" name="ans1"/>  </p><p>(b) List the elements of <m>{\{x : x \text{ is a whole number}, 3x - 2 &lt; 19\}}</m>.</p><p><fillin characters="25" name="ans2"/>  </p></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>(a) The integers with <m>-3 &lt; x \le 2</m> run from <m>-2</m> to <m>2</m>, so the set is <m>\{-2, -1, 0, 1, 2\}</m>.</p><p>(b) Solve the inequality: <m>3x - 2 &lt; 19</m> gives <m>3x &lt; 21</m>, so <m>x &lt; 7</m>. The whole numbers start at <m>0</m>, so the set is <m>\{0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6\}</m>.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>\left \{-2 , -1 , 0 , 1 , 2 \right \}</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>\left \{0 , 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 , 5 , 6 \right \}</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>